# Agent policy

Follow **[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)** for every task in this repository.

Normative spec: `openspec/specs/agent-anti-default/spec.md`

## Non-negotiable

- No invented product UX when specs or tasks are silent (stub, disable, or escalate).
- No auto-save, tree navigation, welcome flows, shortcuts, or themes unless explicitly specified.
- UI/Desktop crates call `core::Session` only — no duplicated graph logic.

When unsure about interaction design, read `AGENTS.md` before implementing.
